### Ana's organizational assignment history (VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client; run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments?$filter=Employee_PersonnelNumber eq '00001234'&$orderby=BeginDate

### A new organizational assignment from 2026-07-01: the old record is delimited to 2026-06-30
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/OrganizationalAssignments
Content-Type: application/json

< ./new-assignment.json

### A new parking permit (time constraint 2): the old record is delimited to 2025-05-31
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/ParkingPermits
Content-Type: application/json

< ./new-permit.json

### Basic pay cannot be deleted (time constraint 1): HTTP 400
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/BasicPayRecords(Employee_PersonnelNumber='00001234',BeginDate=2024-03-01)

### A parking permit can be deleted (time constraint 2): HTTP 204
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/people/ParkingPermits(Employee_PersonnelNumber='00001234',BeginDate=2025-06-01)
